=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Phara} in {z:Bastok Mines} at (J-9).
* Talk to {n:Deidogg} (H-6) {z:Bastok Mines} twice.
** He is at the bottom of the ramp that leads to the guild.
** **After this point the quest can be completed on any job.**
* Go {z:Palborough Mines} and work your way to the top floor. You will find a **???** at (G-10) in a dead end room.
** Home Point #1 is very close. If you don't have the Home Point, {n:Domenic} can also teleport you to Waughroon Shrine which is right next to it.
* Examine it to spawn {m:Ni'Ghu Nestfender}. Defeat the NM who will drop a {i:Mottled Quadav Egg|Mottled Quadav Egg|1101}.
** 3 minute re-spawn.
* Return to Bastok and trade the {i:Mottled Quadav Egg|Mottled Quadav Egg|1101} to {n:Deidogg}.
** You can speak to {n:Deidogg} again for an additional cutscene.
* Go to {z:Castle Oztroja} and kill the {m:Yagudo Parasite} in the pond on the 3rd floor (H-9) for a {i:Parasite Skin|Parasite Skin|1099}.
* Return to Bastok again and trade the {i:Parasite Skin|Parasite Skin|1099} to {n:Deidogg}.
* Wait a game day (after clock rolls around past 00:00). Talk to {n:Deidogg} for your reward.

